# twenty-api — Slice 0 (strangler facade) configuration.
# The only thing needed at this stage: where the legacy NestJS twenty-server lives.
# Everything except the native routes (/healthz) is proxied there.

# Production: the running twenty-server (e.g. the Oracle/Hetzner deploy from HANDOFF.md).
LEGACY_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Later slices add: DATABASE_URL (Neon), UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL/TOKEN, INNGEST keys, AUTH secrets.
